&lt;li&gt;Build security controls tools that emphasize self-service, automation, and performance to help identify and mitigate security flaws.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improve, operate, and maintain security critical services such as authentication and authorization&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Product Teams to deliver secure features&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify and design solutions for new user security concerns or weaknesses&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Research and implement new security capabilities for the Discord platform&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who you are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have 5+ years experience securing production applications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have 3+ years of experience programming in at least one general purpose programming language (e.g. Python, Rust).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are comfortable developing on iOS and/or Android&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have experience leading security projects with a cross-functional group.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have experience operating in cloud-based environments (we use Google Cloud, but experience with other platforms is ok too).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are comfortable reasoning about the security of complex systems, even if they contain components you aren&#39;t familiar with.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bonus points&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
