&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaborative.&lt;/strong&gt; Your updates are transparent and highlight both everything that’s going great and going wrong with a project - bringing your team along for the ride. In addition, you can build strong relationships with your teammates around you.&lt;/li&gt;
