&lt;li&gt;Evaluate and integrate new machine learning frameworks and tools to ensure that Discord keeps up with the fast moving world of ML, including LLMs and generative AI&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with model builders to ensure we have a smooth path from idea to production&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set best practices in machine learning at Discord&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create foundational datasets and models&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
