&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8+ years of experience working as a software engineer in data or backend with exposure to large datasets or distributed systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;4+ years working on platforms or infrastructure&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2+ years working on machine learning platforms&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Know-how with orchestration systems (such as Airflow, Dagster, or Argo).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You&#39;ve put machine learning models into production&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
